OL,3,GNEWSALife in jail for gunman who opened
OL,4,Afire after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for life and a
OL,7,Fsecond told to serve 11 years in prison
OL,8,Fafter a 20-year-old was shot in
OL,9,FRotherham.
OL,11,FReece Barnes, 32, and Micahiah Lewis,
OL,12,F29, assaulted and chased the man on 11
OL,13,FSeptember 2024 before Barnes shot him
OL,14,Fon Ferham Road.
OL,16,FThey were both found guilty of
OL,17,Fpossessing a firearm with intent to
OL,18,Fendanger life after a trial at
OL,19,FSheffield Crown Court, with Barnes also
OL,20,Fguilty of attempted murder.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
