OL,3,GNEWSALife in jail for gunman who opened
OL,4,Afire after chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarnes, of Claremont Street, Rotherham,
OL,7,Fhad previously admitted possession of a
OL,8,Ffirearm with intent to cause fear of
OL,9,Fviolence and grievous bodily harm. He
OL,10,Fwas told he would serve a minimum of 18
OL,11,Fyears and 292 days, while Lewis, of
OL,12,FVikinglea Close, Sheffield, was jailed
OL,13,Ffor 11 years.
